WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.460
Hello? If anyone's in here, the police are on
their way-

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:29.170
Ow! Ow, Ow, Ow, Ow!

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:54.090
Nom!

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.450
What? Why are you staring at me like that?

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:05.870
I thought you were dead. I saw the Duke throw
you down the boo-hoo hole.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:10.970
I was lucky. The walls were jagged with pieces of
Lego. They snagged me, broke my fall,

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.140
but hurt the whole way down.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:15.080
Well, it looks like we're matches, huh?

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:15.920
Red Vines.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.590
Twizzlers. Pull and peel.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.220
This is from a supply raid.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:34.500
And.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:57.750
Uh, are we just going to leave the pupa behind, Terry?

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:01.170
He can't get out of the pupa seat. And even
if he could, he'd never stray from his puffs.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:04.870
Ah.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.700
The cow says.

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:49.790
Eddie. Oh, you're home early.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:50.480
Katie.

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.220
Baby, kiss me.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:52.640
Oh.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.450
Get in here.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:02.540
Still can't believe it was one year ago to
the day you got down on your knee and gave

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:06.690
this to me. Remember? It was our second date.
I thought you were crazy.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.660
I am crazy for you.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.620
I swore I would never go out with someone who
worked for my dad. But you're not like his

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:16.190
other employees. You're. You're different.
Oh. How'd the sales trip go?

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.930
Crushed it. Crushed it.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:19.250
Daddy will love that.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.030
Means he won't see it coming when we rob him
blind.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:26.410
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:27.540
Hup!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:31.590
Hup! Hup! Hup! Ah, I hate doing this because
I'm the cool one who bites the cheese right off

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:35.610
the block instead of cutting off a piece. But
you leave me no choice. No more iPad, no more

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.900
sexy books. No more Hulu.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:49.080
Look at him. He's learning his lesson so hard
right now. Maybe I am the pupa expert.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.430
I did not know that was an option.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.150
Aww, he laid an apology egg.

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:59.270
Apology egg-cepted, Pupa!

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.050
Yeah Buddy!

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.460
What the hell is that?

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:02.120
Little buddy!

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:05.700
Yeah, buddy!

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:08.090
Hahaha Yeah Buddy!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:12.350
How the hell am I supposed to punish him when
he's palling around with a little buddy?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.890
Oh shit. If we had just smashed Pupa's head
with a hammer and thrown him in the quarry,

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:16.940
none of this would have happened.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:31.510
This is the time of year where we are
compelled to gather and celebrate the light

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:36.940
of our Lord and Savior, Jesus Christ. Thank
you all for rejecting the commercialization

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:43.030
of the holiday. Only here in the House of God
can your spirits truly be blessed.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.100
Amen. Oh.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:51.490
Sorry to interrupt the service. I just. I've
made a horrible mistake. My son came out as a

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:57.640
tiny bit bi last week, and I kicked him out
of the house. I've ruined our lives. I miss

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.230
him so much.

